Subject: [PATCH] net: slirp DNS on Android, and build the engine with slirp

---
 contrib/portable/build-engine.py |   2 +-
 include/net/slirp.h              |   5 +-
 net/meson.build                  |   9 ++-
 net/slirp-dns.c                  | 104 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
